                  "size": "half"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Helm by Anyday",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "The WebOps app is the centre of the new site: uptime, speed, SEO and launches for every site in one window, with Asyst and Handbooks included."
