    {
      "slug": "aeon",
      "title": "Aeon Health & Shop",
      "summary": "A new website for a Calgary longevity clinic, with a guided 'Start here' flow — plus an online shop for its supplements.",
      "tags": [
        "Health",
        "Web Design",
        "E-commerce"
      ],
      "scope": [
        "Website redesign",
        "Information architecture",
        "Symptom cards",
        "Video content (Midjourney)",
        "Start-here quiz & booking",
        "Navigation by goal",
        "Aeon Shop"
      ],
      "role": "UI/UX Design",
      "date": "2025",
      "contributors": "Anyday",
      "previewUrl": "https://aeonfuturehealth.com",
      "cover": "aeon/cover.jpg",
      "hero": "aeon/hero.jpg",
      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "Before → After",
          "content": [
            {
              "compare": {
                "before": "aeon/before-home.jpg",
                "after": "aeon/after-home.jpg",
                "beforeLabel": "Before",
                "afterLabel": "Redesign",
                "caption": "Homepage hero"
              }
            },
            {
              "compare": {
                "before": "aeon/before-about.jpg",
                "after": "aeon/after-about.jpg",
                "beforeLabel": "Before",
                "afterLabel": "Redesign",
                "caption": "Second section — from mission statement to the patient's story"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "The problem",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "The old site listed every program in one long dropdown and didn't give new visitors an obvious first step. The redesign leads with how people feel, then guides them to one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Start with how you feel",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "The homepage asks how you feel before it talks about programs. Eight symptom cards cover muscle changes, weight, motivation, fatigue, libido, disease prevention, gut health and brain fog. Hover a card and its video plays while a short description slides up, so people recognise themselves in a few seconds."
            },
            {
              "video": {
                "src": "aeon/rec-cards.mp4",
                "caption": "Hovering through the eight symptom cards on the homepage",
                "layout": "wide",
                "autoplay": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Video made with Midjourney",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "I created the video content on the site with Midjourney, including all eight symptom loops. Each one is a visual metaphor instead of a stock clip of a patient: glowing muscle fibres for strength, a single ember for motivation, a figure dissolving into particles for fatigue, a lone walker in fog for brain fog. They're short, muted loops, so they add motion without getting in the way."
            },
            {
              "video": {
                "src": "aeon/midjourney-grid.mp4",
                "caption": "The eight Midjourney loops used on the symptom cards",
                "layout": "wide",
                "autoplay": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Navigation by goal",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "Programs and therapies are grouped by what the patient wants (hormone changes, low energy, gut and mood, long-term health, strength and recovery) instead of by clinic jargon. One click opens the full menu."
            },
            {
              "video": {
                "src": "aeon/rec-nav.mp4",
                "caption": "Desktop navigation and the Programs by Symptom menu",
                "layout": "wide",
                "autoplay": true
              }
            },
            {
              "img": [
                {
                  "src": "aeon/mobile-menu.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                },
                {
                  "src": "aeon/home-full.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "A clear first step",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "\"Start here\" lets visitors book a free consult straight away, or take a 5-question quiz that ends with a recommended program and a way to book it."
            },
            {
              "video": {
                "src": "aeon/rec-quiz.mp4",
                "caption": "The quiz, from first question to recommendation",
                "layout": "wide",
                "autoplay": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "What to expect",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "Every program page lays out the journey as five steps on a turning arc, from the free first call to reviewing next steps, so patients know what happens before they book."
            },
            {
              "video": {
                "src": "aeon/rec-steps.mp4",
                "caption": "The What to expect steps on a program page",
                "layout": "wide",
                "autoplay": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
